title: 'sp-additional-data: primitive crate and `DigestItem::AdditionalData`'
doc:
- audience: [Node Dev, Runtime Dev]
  description: |-
    Adds `sp-additional-data`, the producer-agnostic primitives for per-block additional data: the
    `AdditionalData` map and its commitment functions, the `AdditionalDataFinalizer` registry held
    in the `AdditionalDataExt` externalities extension, the `CreateAdditionalDataExtensions`
    replay factory, and the `finalize_into` host function. Adds `DigestItem::AdditionalData`,
    discriminant 3, which carries the 32-byte commitment in the header.

    Nothing registers the host function or deposits the digest yet, so existing chains are
    unaffected. Nodes without this change cannot decode a header that carries the new digest item.
crates:
- name: sp-additional-data
  bump: patch
- name: sp-runtime
  bump: major
- name: polkadot-sdk
  bump: minor
